          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your parries and finishers allow you to riposte with the slightest provocation.</p>\n<p>You can use @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Opportune Riposte] against an enemy who fails at a Strike against you (not just critically fails), provided you have both damaged that creature with a finisher on your last turn and currently have a circumstance bonus to AC from the parry weapon trait or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Extravagant Parry].</p>"
          },
